    "paragraph": "OmniTraj introduces a Transformer-based trajectory prediction framework designed to handle varying sensor frame rates and observation horizons. Another study combines the Analytical Hierarchy Process, Genetic Algorithms, and ArcGIS Pro's Location-Allocation tool to optimize neighborhood service accessibility. Finally, ButterMamba improves traffic flow prediction by combining a Butterworth Spectral Filtering module to filter out high-frequency sensor noise with a parallel Mamba-based Spatial-Temporal State Mixer.",
